### INSTRUCTIONS ###

1) Move the CUSTOM-ICONS directory into the USER Module directory.

2) Create your own custom icons using the included custom-icons.sh script.
	- Open a terminal in the CUSTOM-ICONS directory and run `./generate-custom-icons.sh XXXXXX YYY [invert]`
	    - Icons will be generated in `/arcHIVE/QRV/$CALLSIGN/SAVED/CUSTOM-ICONS`
		- Replace "XXXXXX" with the desired hex color (no "#")
		- Replace "YYY" with the desired tint level (0-200)
		- Optionally, include "invert" to change to light text

3) Once satisfied with your custom icons, rename the desired "custom-icons-xxxxxx" directory to "custom-icons"

4) Move the included 00_PRE_CUSTOM-ICONS.sh script into the USER Module directory.
	- Up one level from the CUSTOM-ICONS directory

Notes:
- The module will be active on the next reboot or re-run of Station Setup. You may re-number it if necessary for your ordering preferences.

- To deactivate the module, place the 00_PRE_CUSTOM-ICONS.sh script back inside the CUSTOM-ICONS directory and reboot.

- In multi-user installations, CUSTOM-ICONS will remain configured for a previous user, if the next user does not also use this module.
